  "observations": {
    "source": "Original heart and smile are clean camera-facing cream speech balloons with a lower tail, dark-brown contour, upper-right gold excitement ticks. Heart is pink/red and smile is yellow with closed curved happy eyes, rosy cheeks and broad open mouth. Original atlases show appear opacity/scale growth, idle bob, fade opacity and transition pulse with no fitted view variants.",
    "fixedHeartTarget": "Maintains heart/balloon identity and palette; cream construction has a fuller warm rim, softer broad reflections and rounded heart volume. No unrelated ornament or scene. At82logicalwidth the heart stays instantly legible, tail joined and excitement ticks separate on light/gray/dark.",
    "fixedSmileTarget": "Maintains closed happy eyes, two rosy cheeks, broad open mouth and yellow face in the same puffy cream family; face/tail/ticks stay distinct at82logicalwidth. Slightly fuller face/cream proportions are useful authorized changes, not source-fidelity defects.",
    "family": "Targets share warm ivory/beige balloon bodies, brown/gold rims, broad white highlights and warm lower reflections. Their differing silhouette proportions do not alone harm the family.",
    "sourceContract": "Both packers select one alpha>8source rectangle then uniformly normalize82logicalwidth; both retain complete384x640canvas with logical192x320frame/root96,248/sourceScale2. Main has6x2 atlases2304x1280with S/N/E/W aliases to S; smile has same layout but only actual S registrations.",
